{"id":"conv_04863","context":"A mom answers her young son's big questions about animals","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["yumiko_mom","sho_child"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"sho_child","mood":null,"en":"Hey Mom, why do animals have life too?","jp":"ねえママ、どうして動物にもいのちがあるの？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,6,11,22,1303,1478,1573,2095,5615,7562,7971,12494],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ねえ","w":1573},{"s":"ママ","w":2095},{"s":"、"},{"s":"どうして","w":1478},{"s":"動物","r":"どうぶつ","w":1303},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"いのち","w":7971},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ある","w":22},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"？"}]},{"speaker":"yumiko_mom","mood":null,"en":"Of course. Every living thing has a life of its own.","jp":"あたりまえだよ。生きてるものはみんな、いのちを持ってるの。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,21,40,68,139,185,485,558,1758,4819,5615,7971,8194],"jpTokens":[{"s":"あたりまえ","w":8194},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"生き","r":"いき","w":1758},{"s":"てる","w":139},{"s":"もの","w":40},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"みんな","w":485},{"s":"、"},{"s":"いのち","w":7971},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"持っ","r":"もっ","w":558},{"s":"てる","w":139},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sho_child","mood":null,"en":"Then next question! Why do lions eat zebras? It's scary.","jp":"じゃあ、つぎの質問！どうしてライオンはシマウマを食べちゃうの？こわいよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,5,68,367,396,1388,1467,1478,2544,3480,4777,5001,6220,7562,7900,8238,12494,12898,17132],"jpTokens":[{"s":"じゃあ","w":2544},{"s":"、"},{"s":"つぎ","w":8238},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"質問","r":"しつもん","w":367},{"s":"！"},{"s":"どうして","w":1478},{"s":"ライオン","w":7900},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"シマウマ"},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"食べ","r":"たべ","w":1467},{"s":"ちゃう","w":1388},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"？"},{"s":"こわい","w":12898},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yumiko_mom","mood":null,"en":"The lions are after food, sweetie. It isn't cruelty, it's survival.","jp":"ライオンのお目当てはごはんなんだよ。意地悪じゃなくて、生きるためなの。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,13,21,26,56,57,60,68,132,1758,3480,3755,4777,5419,6220,7900,8158,9101,15329],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ライオン","w":7900},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"お","w":56},{"s":"目当て","r":"めあて","w":8158},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"ごはん","w":5419},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"意地悪","r":"いじわる","w":15329},{"s":"じゃ","w":132},{"s":"なく","w":13},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"生きる","r":"いきる","w":1758},{"s":"ため","w":60},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sho_child","mood":null,"en":"But somehow my chest feels strangely tight… the zebra's family will cry.","jp":"でも、なんだか異様にむねがぎゅっとする……シマウマさんの家族が泣いちゃうよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,6,19,50,68,88,527,1388,1647,3922,6276,7414,8177,17132],"jpTokens":[{"s":"でも","w":88},{"s":"、"},{"s":"なんだか","w":1647},{"s":"異様","r":"いよう","w":8177},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"むね"},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ぎゅっと"},{"s":"する","w":19},{"s":"…"},{"s":"…"},{"s":"シマウマ"},{"s":"さん","w":50},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"家族","r":"かぞく","w":527},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"泣い","r":"ない","w":7414},{"s":"ちゃう","w":1388},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yumiko_mom","mood":null,"en":"Mom is glad you're so kindhearted, Sho. Look, there's a tear on your cheek.","jp":"翔の優しい気持ち、ママうれしいよ。ほら、頬に涙がついてる。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,6,68,444,1759,2095,2861,2902,3670,5001,6181,6826,7718,8125,9154,12357,12576,15144],"jpTokens":[{"s":"翔","r":"しょう","w":12357},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"優しい","r":"やさしい","w":3670},{"s":"気持ち","r":"きもち","w":444},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ママ","w":2095},{"s":"うれしい","w":2902},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"},{"s":"ほら","w":6181},{"s":"、"},{"s":"頬","r":"ほお","w":8125},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"涙","r":"なみだ","w":1759},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"ついてる","w":15144},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sho_child","mood":null,"en":"Maybe getting along with animals is just inherently difficult after all.","jp":"動物とのかかわりって、所詮むずかしいことなのかな。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,9,12,15,16,21,100,1303,2391,2861,5714,6712,8139,8157,8172],"jpTokens":[{"s":"動物","r":"どうぶつ","w